[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15722.389, "timestamp": "04:22:02", "text": "是的。好了，大部分东西我们都拿到了。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15725.79, "timestamp": "04:22:05", "text": "需要出售物品。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15728.389, "timestamp": "04:22:08", "text": "是的，我们完成了三个支线任务。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15731.389, "timestamp": "04:22:11", "text": "在这个地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15735.03, "timestamp": "04:22:15", "text": "地图。哦，还有，我想这是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15736.87, "timestamp": "04:22:16", "text": "最后一个。捕蟹是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15739.11, "timestamp": "04:22:19", "text": "危险的工作。是的，那是最后一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15741.99, "timestamp": "04:22:21", "text": "计划。嘿，那片区域禁止入内。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15744.149, "timestamp": "04:22:24", "text": "你要去哪里？那是马克思主义的风格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15748.87, "timestamp": "04:22:28", "text": "这是我的爱巢。我发誓。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15750.95, "timestamp": "04:22:30", "text": "我从来不让他进我的酒吧。对于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15754.55, "timestamp": "04:22:34", "text": "记录显示，他没能满足我的渴望。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15757.03, "timestamp": "04:22:37", "text": "经常独自喝酒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15774.59, "timestamp": "04:22:54", "text": "多。我该怎么办？所以，我不能去"}]